                      <zone fixed-size='231' forceUpdate='true' h='13277' id='343' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='11277'>
                        <formatted-text>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Bucket Description </run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                          <run fontcolor='#d3293d' fontname='Tableau Bold'>1.Product Shared &amp; Not Listed at vendor- To be assigned to Vendor: </run>
                          <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'> Products Listed in Catalog Chain Level or Barcode are listed in PIM  but not assigned to vendor. These SKU/Barcode are being shared via SFTP </run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run fontcolor='#d3293d' fontname='Tableau Bold'>2.Product Shared &amp; Not Listed- New Content Creation: </run>
                          <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Products are NOT listed in Catalog or PIM. These SKU/barcode are being shared via SFTP</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3293d' fontname='Tableau Bold'>3.Product Shared &amp; Listed - Already Assigned:</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ae0318' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Æ </run>
                          <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Products listed in Catalog and PIM and Updates are being shared by Vendors via SFTP </run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run fontcolor='#d3293d' fontname='Tableau Bold'>4.Products Not shared &amp; Assigned: </run>
                          <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Æ </run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Product are are assigned to vendor in Catalog and listed in PIM but are not being shared by the vendor via SFTP</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>NOTE: All product counts are at vendor x geid level (similar to vendor product id level in catalog). A product will be either SKU or barcode (if SKU is not shared )</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3293d' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Last Refresh: </run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Jan 2nd 2025 ( For time period Dec 1 - Dec 31)</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3293d' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Refresh Frequency:</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'> Monthly</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3293d' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Next refresh: </run>
                          <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Feb 2nd 2025 ( For time period Jan 1 - Jan 30)</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        </formatted-text>
                        <zone-style>
